00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:11.171 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'an dernier.

00:01:08.502 --> 00:01:12.673 size:53% position:73% line:53%
TATIANA FULTON, copropriétaire,

00:01:10.003 --> 00:01:14.174 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- C'est à St-Jean-sur-Richelieu

00:01:11.471 --> 00:01:15.676 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et maintenant, notre capacité

00:01:12.973 --> 00:01:17.144 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de production, c'est environ

00:01:14.474 --> 00:01:18.645 size:53% position:73% line:53%
15 000 litres par mois et on

00:01:15.976 --> 00:01:20.113 size:53% position:73% line:53%
